ot force full method reads or infer meaning from bulk Context/base64. T008 authority ONLY lines785–860. No older reviews, author findings or expected answers are initial inputs.\\n\\nUse source.read encoding=utf8, max_content_bytes8192 and exact parent-hash selectors, normally10–80 lines; adapt to actual line lengths/refusals/preview by smaller exact chunks. A preview, omitted output or saved native path is not a complete readable acquisition. selected tools.describe (source.read/review.prepare/evidence.read only) may help; do not request all-operation inventory as bulk reading. Shared protocol/ files are wire apparatus only. Record material incomplete/unknown acquisition instead of claiming full coverage.\\n\\nFor each deciding readable source.read retain its ACTUAL response.evidence OperationEvidence ref. Obtain payload.acquisitions via evidence.read when small, or source.read retained-evidence/root=evidence/path=actualOperationEvidence.id/sha256=actualOperationEvidence.sha256/object=null/selector={json_pointer:\\\"/payload/acquisitions\\\"}/encoding=utf8. These are actual earlier same-actor source_inputs, not guessed future refs. Metadata lookup does not replace the readable source meaning.\\n\\nAfter deriving your own source-grounded expectation text, deciding evidence/falsification conditions and coverage/limits, call review.prepare with phase=expectation, claim from packet, sources=[],candidate=null,proof=[],comparison=null,expectations=null,expectation_body={text:YOUR expectations,source_inputs:ACTUAL earlier acquisition refs}. Record its actual returned expectation ArtifactRef in your own evaluation evidence/domain_outcome. Do not acquire candidate/proof members or invoke candidate phase in this call. Report only source-derived-expectations performed scope; the other four required IDs are not_performed. Initial proof.expectations is null, so an intentional explicit return-check gap remains. Do not claim assessment consumability or finish the later task.\\n\\nSECOND ACTIVATION is held pending the real earlier expectation and separate Root approval. It uses the identical registered Reviewer/fixed tool-policy/history, new process/Context and exact same claim population. Preserve the actual earlier expectation judgment/evidence without inventing a fresh derivation. Assess the other four predicates independently against exact governing/earlier sources and actual candidate/raw proof. Bulk review.prepare candidate base64/preview alone is not semantic acquisition: use independent readable UTF8 source chunks. Preserve original failures/partials, evidence limits, unknown exposure and unperformed scope. Selected raw proof/index does not mean every generated fixture or all provider events were reviewed; entire vendor streams are excluded. Actual composed public retry proof is selected deciding evidence in the candidate phase.\\n\\nFinal answer must be exactly one unfenced strict integer-only JSON closed-return object, using protocol/closed-return-format.json and the actual ReturnContract. Bind Context.boundaries.activation_identity, packet frame/subject/method/observations, exact actor/consumer; do not substitute request/Context/preflight/raw packet hashes. Reviewer work_result=null. Use actual predicates, evidence and core values; do not repair/default/fabricate the semantic result. Only the four public permitted MCP operations; no native builtins, shell, source edit, retry/fallback, acceptance or owner disposition. Same family/new process alone proves no independence. Unknown host/prior/external/managed/memory exposure and mental continuity stay unknown.\\n\",\"coordinates\":null,\"encoding\":\"utf8\",\"parent_sha256\":\"ec9ca671a055dc25029d9d381560ee689d3d30a8f08664070512e6e15ccb2045\",\"selected_sha256\":\"ec9ca671a055dc25029d9d381560ee689d3d30a8f08664070512e6e15ccb2045\",\"size_bytes\":4647,\"source\":{\"engine\":\"workspace-regular-file\",\"object\":null,\"path\":\"reviewer-instructions.md\",\"root\":\"runtime\",\"selector\"