{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NVXhJXpp8U5z14k6mWsBtL","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"evidence\":{\"id\":\"sha256:318b1decc5c7e1eac93257c927ae75704b1769640a591706a321bc1f476b29eb\",\"sha256\":\"318b1decc5c7e1eac93257c927ae75704b1769640a591706a321bc1f476b29eb\"},\"id\":\"r-task-1\",\"operation\":\"source.read\",\"operation_outcome\":{\"cause\":\"declared output available\",\"core_value\":\"satisfied\",\"evidence\":[],\"limits\":[\"output availability only; no semantic acceptance\"],\"predicate\":\"B(source.read)[request_sha256=518740c504edc3b4579bb38a41d3bbec34bc654cd70f90344187441942782baf]: declared output availability\",\"source_parent\":{\"clause\":\"results\",\"member\":\"FOUNDATIONS.md\",\"sha256\":\"fd2d895f90eb39bda0950c1c7ff02057ef5d8ae73fcbc5b3203f7e99081d6e3f\"},\"value\":\"returned\"},\"refusal\":null,\"result\":{\"artifact\":null,\"value\":{\"acquisition\":{},\"content\":\"# T008 bounded live qualification task — successor 001\\n\\n- id: `urn:a-c:fd-support:T008:live-task:001`\\n- Product: `urn:stdo:product-definition:a-c-implementations`; existing work T-008.\\n- Executive public caller and final task disposition owner: `/root`.\\n- State: limited qualification binding selected by Root; execution held until integrated checks close and each exact call is approved.\\n- Intended new target: `a_c/build_tenants/graphify/examples/fd-support/LIFECYCLE_QUICKSTART.md` (currently absent).\\n\\nThe intended outcome is: an actual registered F_P Worker authors the absent\\npublic LIFECYCLE_QUICKSTART.md through ordinary source/contract acquisition and\\ngranted work.write, followed by a distinct registered nonauthor Reviewer\\nrecording source-derived expectations before candidate exposure in one actual\\nactivation, then assessing the guide plus frozen support implementation/design/\\nproof in a second separately approved activation of that same registered\\nReviewer, with the actual earlier expectation frozen in its ReturnContract.\\n\\nThis succeeds the immutable [preparation TASK](../live-preparation/TASK.md),\\nSHA-256 `3dc7c91a91c672c7721559025e9252c395ce8f5da4ce064f995d973b97cc9ec6`.\\nOnly the actual call split and current binding selection change; artifact\\nacceptance criteria remain the supplied goals, not an answer or finding.\\n\\nThis is supplied WHAT for one qualification artifact, not a new Product WHAT,\\nmethod, task ledger or prewritten answer. T-008 owns work state. No private\\nstudy oracle or automatic adoption of recommendations is permitted.\\n\\n## Artifact acceptance criteria supplied by the Executive\\n\\n1. Produce useful Markdown of at most 140 lines in the named guide.\\n2. Show how a software-development Executive selects/discovers exact tool\\n   contracts, binds current source/context, and hands a named granted task to a\\n   Worker, then makes source/proof independently acquirable to a Reviewer.\\n3. Include at least one concrete full-envelope CLI/MCP usage reference grounded\\n   in the actual public contracts. Acquire the contract; do not invent fields,\\n   private builders, a study adapter or an unregistered execution route.\\n4. Distinguish exact-byte/structural evidence, performed F_P judgment,\\n   recommendation and owner disposition.\\n5. State that only the granted Worker/Writer may mutate the named target;\\n   source-first expectations precede candidate bytes; the caller selects the\\n   next action; uncertain effects and currentness remain explicit.\\n6. Cite actual local governing/tool sources and state honest unsupported and\\n   qualification boundaries. Make no savings, quality gain, complete-calculus,\\n   adoption or release claim, and do not duplicate STDO methodology.\\n\\nThese criteria are goals for the actor's work, not supplied guide prose or\\nReviewer findings. Root's final task disposition is separate from Product\\nacceptance; any recommendations remain evidence until their actual owner acts.\\n\\n## Exact basis and ordinary acquisition\\n\\nThe installed builder remains STDO v2.5.1-rc.2 manifest\\n`3d860ff4c1746f06ac25295a9e205cffb8e7725869615ac77cf2304b70ff2782`.\\nThe work-scoped method is Claude RC9 source\\n`c2cfa9b908d1722ae3f26c32fa4ece691083bdc3`, standards tree\\n`98de394b352179c25dfa63b0b59a9b6bdd43632d`, with Executive and Design profiles;\\nthis is candidate dogfood, not a changed constitution or adopted V3 release.\\n\\nGoverning sources are the existing [Product](../../../../specification/PRODUCT.md),\\n[FD requirements](../../../../specification/requirements/fd-support-tools.md)\\nand [qualification requirements](../../../../specification/requirements/fd-support-verification.md),\\nplus exact selected RC9 members in [source custody](../live-preparation/SOURCE_MANIFEST.json).\\nThe [current HOW](../../../../build_tenants/graphify/design/fd-support.md),\\n[public setup](../../../../build_tenants/graphify/examples/fd-support/README.md),\\npublic core/adapter and actual selected proof are acquired directly when their\\nrole/phase permits. The HOW Public wire grammar and tools.describe contract\\nare concrete discovery references; the Worker must derive its usage example\\nfrom actual ordinary contracts and observed acquisition.\\n\\nCopies preserve exact parent bytes and hashes; they grant no operation and are\\nnot evidence of actor acquisition. The source manifest distinguishes governing\\ninputs from candidate/control/proof material. Root must select the complete\\nfinal candidate population after mechanical qualification. Before recording\\nReviewer expectations, deliver no guide or selected candidate implementation,\\ndesign, tests/fixtures/proof content; record prior/tool/setup/external exposure\\nand unknowns honestly. Later candidate/proof acquisition must use the same\\nclaim/source identities, without a summary substituting for the source.\\n\\n## Role, effect and evidence limits\\n\\nRoot is the actual Executive public caller. There are three planned actual\\nregistered Claude CLI activations: one Worker, then two of the same registered\\nnonauthor Reviewer. Worker and Reviewer producer bindings are distinct. The\\nfirst Reviewer activation records source-first expectations before candidate\\nbytes and need not close the candidate assessment. The second assesses the\\ncandidate/proof with the actual earlier expectation frozen in its ReturnContract.\\nEach activation has its own process and Context; mental continuity is unknown,\\nand same model family supplies no independence.\\nOnly the exact Worker/Writer grant may create the absent target through\\nwork.write; Executive and Reviewer acquire/assess, without target mutation.\\nDeclared identities, fresh contexts and source-first ordering do not alone\\ncertify all semantic independence. The selected policy and actual evidence own\\nthat judgment; unestablished premises remain gaps.\\n\\nRoot now selects the limited Product-located [runtime binding](runtime-binding.selected.json)\\nin T-008 for this bounded qualification only. That selection is not an\\nontology/design gate or Product acceptance. Dispatch effectiveness stays held\\nuntil integrated mechanical qualification closes and Root separately approves\\neach exact registered call. This TASK selects no actor settings or actual\\nactivation and authorizes no target write. No actual actor, live evidence root\\nor guide is created by this authoring grant.\\n\\nThe immutable [preparation prerequisites](../live-preparation/PREREQUISITES.md)\\nretain their historical two-call proposal. This successor replaces only that\\ncall count and unselected-binding standing; all remaining unmet prerequisites\\napply to the exact three approved activations. Preserve actual attempts, original\\nreturns, currentness/exposure facts, failed or unknown effects and measured\\nresource scope. No silent retry, inferred completion, accepted benefit,\\npublication, installation, acceptance or release follows from this task.\\n\",\"coordinates\":null,\"encoding\":\"utf8\",\"parent_sha256\":\"6d777ece58832ec57185f47cbe69f714222329e600b3a190acac63d7d744fff2\",\"selected_sha256\":\"6d777ece58832ec57185f47cbe69f714222329e600b3a190acac63d7d744fff2\",\"size_bytes\":6829,\"source\":{\"engine\":\"workspace-regular-file\",\"object\":null,\"path\":\".ai-workspace/qualification/t008/live-binding-001/TASK.md\",\"root\":\"product\",\"selector\":null,\"sha256\":\"6d777ece58832ec57185f47cbe69f714222329e600b3a190acac63d7d744fff2\"}}},\"schema\":\"a_c.fd-support.response/1\",\"status\":\"ok\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b9ee27ae-0996-4105-ba6f-30f3c0f28675","uuid":"9ba94bb6-b1bf-4fbd-9f21-f27f010a7c2b","timestamp":"2026-10-19T04:26:01.672Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"evidence\":{\"id\":\"sha256:318b1decc5c7e1eac93257c927ae75704b1769640a591706a321bc1f476b29eb\",\"sha256\":\"318b1decc5c7e1eac93257c927ae75704b1769640a591706a321bc1f476b29eb\"},\"id\":\"r-task-1\",\"operation\":\"source.read\",\"operation_outcome\":{\"cause\":\"declared output available\",\"core_value\":\"satisfied\",\"evidence\":[],\"limits\":[\"output availability only; no semantic acceptance\"],\"predicate\":\"B(source.read)[request_sha256=518740c504edc3b4579bb38a41d3bbec34bc654cd70f90344187441942782baf]: declared output availability\",\"source_parent\":{\"clause\":\"results\",\"member\":\"FOUNDATIONS.md\",\"sha256\":\"fd2d895f90eb39bda0950c1c7ff02057ef5d8ae73fcbc5b3203f7e99081d6e3f\"},\"value\":\"returned\"},\"refusal\":null,\"result\":{\"artifact\":null,\"value\":{\"acquisition\":{},\"content\":\"# T008 bounded live qualification task — successor 001\\n\\n- id: `urn:a-c:fd-support:T008:live-task:001`\\n- Product: `urn:stdo:product-definition:a-c-implementations`; existing work T-008.\\n- Executive public caller and final task disposition owner: `/root`.\\n- State: limited qualification binding selected by Root; execution held until integrated checks close and each exact call is approved.\\n- Intended new target: `a_c/build_tenants/graphify/examples/fd-support/LIFECYCLE_QUICKSTART.md` (currently absent).\\n\\nThe intended outcome is: an actual registered F_P Worker authors the absent\\npublic LIFECYCLE_QUICKSTART.md through ordinary source/contract acquisition and\\ngranted work.write, followed by a distinct registered nonauthor Reviewer\\nrecording source-derived expectations before candidate exposure in one actual\\nactivation, then assessing the guide plus frozen support implementation/design/\\nproof in a second separately approved activation of that same registered\\nReviewer, with the actual earlier expectation frozen in its ReturnContract.\\n\\nThis succeeds the immutable [preparation TASK](../live-preparation/TASK.md),\\nSHA-256 `3dc7c91a91c672c7721559025e9252c395ce8f5da4ce064f995d973b97cc9ec6`.\\nOnly the actual call split and current binding selection change; artifact\\nacceptance criteria remain the supplied goals, not an answer or finding.\\n\\nThis is supplied WHAT for one qualification artifact, not a new Product WHAT,\\nmethod, task ledger or prewritten answer. T-008 owns work state. No private\\nstudy oracle or automatic adoption of recommendations is permitted.\\n\\n## Artifact acceptance criteria supplied by the Executive\\n\\n1. Produce useful Markdown of at most 140 lines in the named guide.\\n2. Show how a software-development Executive selects/discovers exact tool\\n   contracts, binds current source/context, and hands a named granted task to a\\n   Worker, then makes source/proof independently acquirable to a Reviewer.\\n3. Include at least one concrete full-envelope CLI/MCP usage reference grounded\\n   in the actual public contracts. Acquire the contract; do not invent fields,\\n   private builders, a study adapter or an unregistered execution route.\\n4. Distinguish exact-byte/structural evidence, performed F_P judgment,\\n   recommendation and owner disposition.\\n5. State that only the granted Worker/Writer may mutate the named target;\\n   source-first expectations precede candidate bytes; the caller selects the\\n   next action; uncertain effects and currentness remain explicit.\\n6. Cite actual local governing/tool sources and state honest unsupported and\\n   qualification boundaries. Make no savings, quality gain, complete-calculus,\\n   adoption or release claim, and do not duplicate STDO methodology.\\n\\nThese criteria are goals for the actor's work, not supplied guide prose or\\nReviewer findings. Root's final task disposition is separate from Product\\nacceptance; any recommendations remain evidence until their actual owner acts.\\n\\n## Exact basis and ordinary acquisition\\n\\nThe installed builder remains STDO v2.5.1-rc.2 manifest\\n`3d860ff4c1746f06ac25295a9e205cffb8e7725869615ac77cf2304b70ff2782`.\\nThe work-scoped method is Claude RC9 source\\n`c2cfa9b908d1722ae3f26c32fa4ece691083bdc3`, standards tree\\n`98de394b352179c25dfa63b0b59a9b6bdd43632d`, with Executive and Design profiles;\\nthis is candidate dogfood, not a changed constitution or adopted V3 release.\\n\\nGoverning sources are the existing [Product](../../../../specification/PRODUCT.md),\\n[FD requirements](../../../../specification/requirements/fd-support-tools.md)\\nand [qualification requirements](../../../../specification/requirements/fd-support-verification.md),\\nplus exact selected RC9 members in [source custody](../live-preparation/SOURCE_MANIFEST.json).\\nThe [current HOW](../../../../build_tenants/graphify/design/fd-support.md),\\n[public setup](../../../../build_tenants/graphify/examples/fd-support/README.md),\\npublic core/adapter and actual selected proof are acquired directly when their\\nrole/phase permits. The HOW Public wire grammar and tools.describe contract\\nare concrete discovery references; the Worker must derive its usage example\\nfrom actual ordinary contracts and observed acquisition.\\n\\nCopies preserve exact parent bytes and hashes; they grant no operation and are\\nnot evidence of actor acquisition. The source manifest distinguishes governing\\ninputs from candidate/control/proof material. Root must select the complete\\nfinal candidate population after mechanical qualification. Before recording\\nReviewer expectations, deliver no guide or selected candidate implementation,\\ndesign, tests/fixtures/proof content; record prior/tool/setup/external exposure\\nand unknowns honestly. Later candidate/proof acquisition must use the same\\nclaim/source identities, without a summary substituting for the source.\\n\\n## Role, effect and evidence limits\\n\\nRoot is the actual Executive public caller. There are three planned actual\\nregistered Claude CLI activations: one Worker, then two of the same registered\\nnonauthor Reviewer. Worker and Reviewer producer bindings are distinct. The\\nfirst Reviewer activation records source-first expectations before candidate\\nbytes and need not close the candidate assessment. The second assesses the\\ncandidate/proof with the actual earlier expectation frozen in its ReturnContract.\\nEach activation has its own process and Context; mental continuity is unknown,\\nand same model family supplies no independence.\\nOnly the exact Worker/Writer grant may create the absent target through\\nwork.write; Executive and Reviewer acquire/assess, without target mutation.\\nDeclared identities, fresh contexts and source-first ordering do not alone\\ncertify all semantic independence. The selected policy and actual evidence own\\nthat judgment; unestablished premises remain gaps.\\n\\nRoot now selects the limited Product-located [runtime binding](runtime-binding.selected.json)\\nin T-008 for this bounded qualification only. That selection is not an\\nontology/design gate or Product acceptance. Dispatch effectiveness stays held\\nuntil integrated mechanical qualification closes and Root separately approves\\neach exact registered call. This TASK selects no actor settings or actual\\nactivation and authorizes no target write. No actual actor, live evidence root\\nor guide is created by this authoring grant.\\n\\nThe immutable [preparation prerequisites](../live-preparation/PREREQUISITES.md)\\nretain their historical two-call proposal. This successor replaces only that\\ncall count and unselected-binding standing; all remaining unmet prerequisites\\napply to the exact three approved activations. Preserve actual attempts, original\\nreturns, currentness/exposure facts, failed or unknown effects and measured\\nresource scope. No silent retry, inferred completion, accepted benefit,\\npublication, installation, acceptance or release follows from this task.\\n\",\"coordinates\":null,\"encoding\":\"utf8\",\"parent_sha256\":\"6d777ece58832ec57185f47cbe69f714222329e600b3a190acac63d7d744fff2\",\"selected_sha256\":\"6d777ece58832ec57185f47cbe69f714222329e600b3a190acac63d7d744fff2\",\"size_bytes\":6829,\"source\":{\"engine\":\"workspace-regular-file\",\"object\":null,\"path\":\".ai-workspace/qualification/t008/live-binding-001/TASK.md\",\"root\":\"product\",\"selector\":null,\"sha256\":\"6d777ece58832ec57185f47cbe69f714222329e600b3a190acac63d7d744fff2\"}}},\"schema\":\"a_c.fd-support.response/1\",\"status\":\"ok\"}","structuredContent":{"evidence":{"id":"sha256:318b1decc5c7e1eac93257c927ae75704b1769640a591706a321bc1f476b29eb","sha256":"318b1decc5c7e1eac93257c927ae75704b1769640a591706a321bc1f476b29eb"},"id":"r-task-1","operation":"source.read","operation_outcome":{"cause":"declared output available","core_value":"satisfied","evidence":[],"limits":["output availability only; no semantic acceptance"],"predicate":"B(source.read)[request_sha256=518740c504edc3b4579bb38a41d3bbec34bc654cd70f90344187441942782baf]: declared output availability","source_parent":{"clause":"results","member":"FOUNDATIONS.md","sha256":"fd2d895f90eb39bda0950c1c7ff02057ef5d8ae73fcbc5b3203f7e99081d6e3f"},"value":"returned"},"refusal":null,"result":{"artifact":null,"value":{"acquisition":{},"content":"# T008 bounded live qualification task — successor 001\n\n- id: `urn:a-