d F_P judgments and owner rulings.\\n**Limit:** F_P selects material relations and interprets unresolved applicability;\\nthe tool does not infer semantic edges, prescribe re-entry or select a frontier.\\nAn absent path in incomplete coverage cannot establish non-influence. Owners:\\n[FOUND](fd-source-owner-map.md#found) Change impact and evidence reuse;\\n[RF](fd-source-owner-map.md#rf) §6/8/10;\\n[ACT](fd-source-owner-map.md#act) §1 Applicability;\\n[SPEC](fd-source-owner-map.md#spec) §4.\\n\\n### REQ-AC-FD-005 — Assemble and check selected actor context\\n\\n**Input:** caller-selected frame/configuration and exact method packet contract,\\nsubject/basis, seeds and governing dependency semantics, allowed acquisition\\nroutes, supplied role/authority and actor envelope. **Output/checks:** an exact\\nprojection of the supplied binding with actual acquired record/source content,\\nsource references, declared closure and boundaries; a manifest of what was\\nsupplied versus still to be acquired; and scoped completeness/identity/fit\\nchecks under the selected contract. Where context capacity is declared, measure\\nits stated boundary/unit before read, retaining any unmeasured/unknown host\\ncontext. Preserve the selected method's qualifications, result relation and\\nstop/refusal semantics. **Limit:** do not invent packet fields as a second method,\\nsilently truncate required content or claim semantic sufficiency from closure,\\nsize or schema. Exact late acquisition is visible and follows the supplied\\nmethod contract. Owners: [RF](fd-source-owner-map.md#rf) §11, RF-013/014;\\n[ACT](fd-source-owner-map.md#act) §2;\\n[EXEC](fd-source-owner-map.md#exec) §19 only when that profile is selected.\\n\\n### REQ-AC-FD-006 — Preflight a Product-bound execution contract\\n\\n**Input:** caller-supplied work contract, governing outcome/grant, exact admission\\nbinding/checks and any existing admission or permitted override evidence,\\noperation/tools/territory/envelope and named durable result/evidence surface.\\n**Output/checks:** deterministic preflight findings over those inputs and\\nadmission evidence obtained from the selected Product-bound mechanism where\\n\",\"coordinates\":{\"lines\":[51,110]},\"encoding\":\"utf8\",\"parent_sha256\":\"e3fcebd7e9fbc60dc36ed4c02ee834a96f14226af134809c938169d4712dfc23\",\"selected_sha256\":\"da3a0fcc03c0a41588f2e0d66343461d9dddd9f486ef5c158c6a1ceb92ebae50\",\"size_bytes\":3726,\"source\":{\"engine\":\"workspace-regular-file\",\"object\":null,\"path\":\"specification/requirements/fd-support-tools.md\",\"root\":\"product\",\"selector\":{\"lines\":[51,110]},\"sha256\":\"e3fcebd7e9fbc60dc36ed4c02ee834a96f14226af134809c938169d4712dfc23\"}}},\"schema\":\"a_c.fd-support.response/1\",\"status\":\"ok\"}","structuredContent":{"evidence":{"id":"sha256:407992a30fb8a40ddebba83133d713117091548c3d6372286fb8a63f48580832","sha256":"407992a30fb8a40ddebba83133d713117091548c3d6372286fb8a63f48580832"},"id":"r-fdt-2","operation":"source.read","operation_outcome":{"cause":"declared output available","core_value":"satisfied","evidence":[],"limits":["output availability only; no semantic acceptance"],"predicate":"B(source.read)[request_sha256=b50ee447e6f092a5c8989e58b620be91e62cc22e26f334e88f0e5159e356fd44]: declared output availability","source_parent":{"clause":"results","member":"FOUNDATIONS.md","sha256":"fd2d895f90eb39bda0950c1c7ff02057ef5d8ae73fcbc5b3203f7e99081d6e3f"},"value":"returned"},"refusal":null,"result":{"artifact":null,"value":{"acquisition":{},"content":"[ACT](fd-source-owner-map.md#act) §5/7.\n\n### REQ-AC-FD-003 — Resolve records, source and grounding\n\n**Input:** exact model/record/source identities, selected mappings or search\nscope and permitted acquisition routes. **Output/checks:** found record payloads,\nactual source content and their exact routes/digests, original grounding,\nowner/mapping coordinates, coverage dispositions and unresolved boundaries.\nLiteral/structural searches identify their scope; missing, ambiguous, stale,\nwrong-basis or ungrounded references return the relevant gap. Workers and\nReviewers can acquire raw deciding source directly rather than relying on an\nExecutive/author summary. **Limit:** a locator or manifest is distinct from\nacquired content. Search, code edges and extraction confidence cannot author\nsemantic/governing mappings or establish fidelity. Owners:\n[ACT](fd-source-owner-map.md#act) §2 Acquisition/Standalone scope;\n[PDEF](fd-source-owner-map.md#pdef) §11;\n[EVAL](fd-source-owner-map.md#eval) §1–3.\n\n### REQ-AC-FD-004 — Query declared dependencies, impact and coverage\n\n**Input:** exact selected model(s), caller-selected seeds, authored typed\ndependency/impact/coverage relations, conditional predicates or already-recorded\napplicability, and explicit cross-model identity/translation rules where used.\n**Output/checks:** reproducible closure/path/impact/coverage results, included\nand missing declared obligations/dependencies, predicate results only for the\nsupported supplied decidable contract, and qualifications/residuals/boundaries.\nShow computed facts separately from supplied F_P judgments and owner rulings.\n**Limit:** F_P selects material relations and interprets unresolved applicability;\nthe tool does not infer semantic edges, prescribe re-entry or select a frontier.\nAn absent path in incomplete coverage cannot establish non-influence. Owners:\n[FOUND](fd-source-owner-map.md#found) Change impact and evidence reuse;\n[RF](fd-source-owner-map.md#rf) §6/8/10;\n[ACT](fd-source-owner-map.md#act) §1 Applicability;\n[SPEC](fd-source-owner-map.md#spec) §4.\n\n### REQ-AC-FD-005 — Assemble and check selected actor context\n\n**Input:** caller-selected frame/configuration and exact method packet contract,\nsubject/basis, seeds and governing dependency semantics, allowed acquisition\nroutes, supplied role/authority and actor envelope. **Output/checks:** an exact\nprojection of the supplied binding with actual acquired record/source content,\nsource references, declared closure and boundaries; a manifest of what was\nsupplied versus still to be acquired; and scoped completeness/identity/fit\nchecks under the selected contract. Where context capacity is declared, measure\nits stated boundary/unit before read, retaining any unmeasured/unknown host\ncontext. Preserve the selected method's qualifications, result relation and\nstop/refusal semantics. **Limit:** do not invent packet fields as a second method,\nsilently truncate required content or claim semantic sufficiency from closure,\nsize or schema. Exact late acquisition is visible and follows the supplied\nmethod contract. Owners: [RF](fd-source-owner-map.md#rf) §11, RF-013/014;\n[ACT](fd-source-owner-map.md#act) §2;\n[EXEC](fd-source-owner-map.md#exec) §19 only when that profile is selected.\n\n### REQ-AC-FD-006 — Preflight a Product-bound execution contract\n\n**Input:** caller-supplied work contract, governing outcome/grant, exact admission\nbinding/checks and any existing admission or permitted override evidence,\noperation/tools/territory/envelope and named durable result/evidence surface.\n**Output/checks:** deterministic preflight findings over those inputs and\nadmission evidence obtained from the selected Product-bound mechanism where\n","coordinates":{"lines":[51,110]},"encoding":"utf8","parent_sha256":"e3fcebd7e9fbc60dc36ed4c02ee834a96f14226af134809c938169d4712dfc23","selected_sha256":"da3a0fcc03c0a41588f2e0d66343461d9dddd9f486ef5c158c6a1ceb92ebae50","size_bytes":3726,"source":{"engine":"workspace-regular-file","object":null,"path":"specification/requirements/fd-support-tools.md","root":"product","selector":{"lines":[51,110]},"sha256":"e3fcebd7e9fbc60dc36ed4c02ee834a96f14226af134809c938169d4712dfc23"}}},"schema":"a_c.fd-support.response/1","status":"ok"}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01CrRaUUokX8e7kq1yZHek7D","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
