{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FDYFLH36wMnR8eohpy2S1R","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"evidence\":{\"id\":\"sha256:53f040eae9d69ce0bf0175fba09e05ce8975429fe02dd22edc9f469a8398f210\",\"sha256\":\"53f040eae9d69ce0bf0175fba09e05ce8975429fe02dd22edc9f469a8398f210\"},\"id\":\"r-fdv-3\",\"operation\":\"source.read\",\"operation_outcome\":{\"cause\":\"declared output available\",\"core_value\":\"satisfied\",\"evidence\":[],\"limits\":[\"output availability only; no semantic acceptance\"],\"predicate\":\"B(source.read)[request_sha256=07be11ca68e792a4effd26127b0a541854c00719c3a2caecdf02c433a7d57c24]: declared output availability\",\"source_parent\":{\"clause\":\"results\",\"member\":\"FOUNDATIONS.md\",\"sha256\":\"fd2d895f90eb39bda0950c1c7ff02057ef5d8ae73fcbc5b3203f7e99081d6e3f\"},\"value\":\"returned\"},\"refusal\":null,\"result\":{\"artifact\":null,\"value\":{\"acquisition\":{},\"content\":\"context preparation, refresh, invocation, failed attempts/retries, repair,\\nreview and decision effort, with measurement boundaries and unknowns. Report\\nobserved differences and limitations rather than inferring a general benefit\\nfrom count, graph size, fit or structural success. Owners:\\n[ACT](fd-source-owner-map.md#act) §6;\\n[EVAL](fd-source-owner-map.md#eval) §1;\\n[FOUND](fd-source-owner-map.md#found) Assertions and observation/Change impact\\nand evidence reuse.\\n\\n## Scenario and requirement trace\\n\\nThe following is written test-case authority, not executed evidence. FD-nnn\\nexpands to `REQ-AC-FD-nnn`; FDV-nnn expands to `REQ-AC-FDV-nnn`. Each case supplies\\nthe exact applicable upstream contract; the table does not redefine its states,\\n\",\"coordinates\":{\"lines\":[51,64]},\"encoding\":\"utf8\",\"parent_sha256\":\"3746e614a5ddc3f0a551e926998f16d6101cc037c5c43b879b4447b017a8dbdf\",\"selected_sha256\":\"7275a08e17fa5ac9a6a28b085527b4dabd78dd9c731a6b8fc0ed319c3c579887\",\"size_bytes\":743,\"source\":{\"engine\":\"works