{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GnjDYkfSzXM4LBciZ1YyBd","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"evidence\":{\"id\":\"sha256:338d36f720c67bb5e777a2cf2660f7bd1c4049aeadb69850f5103c37452c3c6c\",\"sha256\":\"338d36f720c67bb5e777a2cf2660f7bd1c4049aeadb69850f5103c37452c3c6c\"},\"id\":\"r-fdt-4\",\"operation\":\"source.read\",\"operation_outcome\":{\"cause\":\"declared output available\",\"core_value\":\"satisfied\",\"evidence\":[],\"limits\":[\"output availability only; no semantic acceptance\"],\"predicate\":\"B(source.read)[request_sha256=05736dca3665607c67b33a6d0209bfd0fe249f3e22f2623a1e10a8b7b47947d5]: declared output availability\",\"source_parent\":{\"clause\":\"results\",\"member\":\"FOUNDATIONS.md\",\"sha256\":\"fd2d895f90eb39bda0950c1c7ff02057ef5d8ae73fcbc5b3203f7e99081d6e3f\"},\"value\":\"returned\"},\"refusal\":null,\"result\":{\"artifact\":null,\"value\":{\"acquisition\":{},\"content\":\"### REQ-AC-FD-010 — Execute declared checks and method-owned joins\\n\\n**Input:** exact subject/observations, selected executable or reproducible\\ndecidable predicate/proof contract and its provenance/domain/limits, or a\\nselected method-owned conjunction/translation with required coverage and inputs.\\n**Output/checks:** reproducible `F_D[v]` judgments for the properties actually\\nevaluated, counterexamples/gaps, and joins computed only under the supplied\\nqualified operator. Preserve source predicate, original domain outcomes,\\nnot-performed assessments, uncovered obligations and incompatibilities as the\\nowner contract requires. Retain assertion/observation and execution identities.\\n**Limit:** do not invent an algebra or stronger claim, turn a necessary-condition\\npass into full satisfaction, execute an unsupported arbitrary calculus operation\\nor replace F_P/owner judgment. Owners: [AC](fd-source-owner-map.md#ac) §5;\\n[FOUND](fd-source-owner-map.md#found) Results/Conjunction of results/Assertions\\nand observation; [EVAL](fd-source-owner-map.md#eval) §1/2;\\n[ASSURE](fd-source-owner-map.md#assure) §10.\\n\\n### REQ-AC-FD-011 — Project and record existing work/evidence facts\\n\\n**Input:** selected authoritative work/evidence carriers, caller-selected view,\\nor an already-authorized actor/owner record and exact named Writer interface,\\ngrant, target preimage and update conditions. **Output/checks:** source-linked\\nprojections of existing work, progress/support, residuals and next-action\\nscope/support/owner; for an authorized write, the exact applied record and\\nobserved effect/result identity or refusal. Preserve original owner wording\\nseparately from interpretation and method-owned distinctions among verdict,\\nrecommendation, disposition, checkpoint, closure and release. **Limit:** create\\nno rival task ledger, owner decision, role transition or continuation grant;\\nthe tool records a supplied decision, never mechanically adopts a review\\nrecommendation or mutates as an F_P Executive/Reviewer. Owners:\\n[PDEF](fd-source-owner-map.md#pdef) §8;\\n[TICK](fd-source-owner-map.md#tick) §7;\\n[ACT](fd-source-owner-map.md#act) §5;\\n[EVAL](fd-source-owner-map.md#eval) §4;\\n[EXEC](fd-source-owner-map.md#exec) §6 if selected.\\n\\n### REQ-AC-FD-012 — Compute affected refresh and prepare reusable handoff\\n\\n**Input:** old/current source observations, exact dependency/impact declarations,\\ndeclared invalidators, existing results/rulings and caller-selected recovery or\\nreuse contract. **Output/checks:** source/derived differences, affected projection\\nand evidence candidates, missing dependency coverage, method-prescribed\\ninvalidation/applicability check results where decidable, and a reconstructable\\nhandoff of still-applicable support, original records/successors, residuals and\\nunreconciled effects. Reacquire named current inputs for the next dependent\\naction; retain partial writes rather than assuming a reset. **Limit:** do not\\nerase history/frozen studies, rewrite old judgments onto new subjects, infer\\nunaffectedness from absent edges, or require replay/rebuild of valid unchanged\\nsupport merely because a session/role changed. F_P resolves unsupported semantic\\nimpact or preservation premises. Owners: [FOUND](fd-source-owner-map.md#found)\\nChange impact and evidence reuse; [RF](fd-source-owner-map.md#rf) §10;\\n[ACT](fd-source-owner-map.md#act) §5/7;\\n[TICK](fd-source-owner-map.md#tick) §7.\\n\\n### REQ-AC-FD-013 — Retain attempt, usage and uncertainty evidence\\n\\n**Input:** invocation/acquisition/check/refresh/repair/review attempt observations\\nand selected accounting/resource contract. **Output/checks:** bound attempt and\\ncost records with units, measured scope, elapsed versus summed actor intervals,\\navailable usage/cache counters, partial/failed calls, unknown counters and any\\n\",\"coordinates\":{\"lines\":[171,230]},\"encoding\":\"utf8\",\"parent_sha256\":\"e3fcebd7e9fbc60dc36ed4c02ee834a96f14226af134809c938169d4712dfc23\",\"selected_sha256\":\"3085b5ff2e945194f11705c06fc7f1e6386a438aa48dbbc470308b83b80e7c02\",\"size_bytes\":3802,\"source\":{\"engine\":\"workspace-regular-file\",\"object\":null,\"path\":\"specification/requirements/fd-support-tools.md\",\"root\":\"product\",\"selector\":{\"lines\":[171,230]},\"sha256\":\"e3fcebd7e9fbc60dc36ed4c02ee834a96f14226af134809c938169d4712dfc23\"}}},\"schema\":\"a_c.fd-support.response/1\",\"status\":\"ok\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b9ee27ae-0996-4105-ba6f-30f3c0f28675","uuid":"c53187b1-1bfb-433c-8b01-479948031275","timestamp":"2026-10-19T04:27:10.942Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"evidence\":{\"id\":\"sha256:338d36f720c67bb5e777a2cf2660f7bd1c4049aeadb69850f5103c37452c3c6c\",\"sha256\":\"338d36f720c67bb5e777a2cf2660f7bd1c4049aeadb69850f5103c37452c3c6c\"},\"id\":\"r-fdt-4\",\"operation\":\"source.read\",\"operation_outcome\":{\"cause\":\"declared output available\",\"core_value\":\"satisfied\",\"evidence\":[],\"limits\":[\"output availability only; no semantic acceptance\"],\"predicate\":\"B(source.read)[request_sha256=05736dca3665607c67b33a6d0209bfd0fe249f3e22f2623a1e10a8b7b47947d5]: declared output availability\",\"source_parent\":{\"clause\":\"results\",\"member\":\"FOUNDATIONS.md\",\"sha256\":\"fd2d895f90eb39bda0950c1c7ff02057ef5d8ae73fcbc5b3203f7e99081d6e3f\"},\"value\":\"returned\"},\"refusal\":null,\"result\":{\"artifact\":null,\"value\":{\"acquisition\":{},\"content\":\"### REQ-AC-FD-010 — Execute declared checks and method-owned joins\\n\\n**Input:** exact subject/observations, selected executable or reproducible\\ndecidable predicate/proof contract and its provenance/domain/limits, or a\\nselected method-owned conjunction/translation with required coverage and inputs.\\n**Output/checks:** reproducible `F_D[v]` judgments for the properties actually\\nevaluated, counterexamples/gaps, and joins computed only under the supplied\\nqualified operator. Preserve source predicate, original domain outcomes,\\nnot-performed assessments, uncovered obligations and incompatibilities as the\\nowner contract requires. Retain assertion/observation and execution identities.\\n**Limit:** do not invent an algebra or stronger claim, turn a necessary-condition\\npass into full satisfaction, execute an unsupported arbitrary calculus operation\\nor replace F_P/owner judgment. Owners: [AC](fd-source-owner-map.md#ac) §5;\\n[FOUND](fd-source-owner-map.md#found) Results/Conjunction of results/Assertions\\nand observation; [EVAL](fd-source-owner-map.md#eval) §1/2;\\n[ASSURE](fd-source-owner-map.md#assure) §10.\\n\\n### REQ-AC-FD-011 — Project and record existing work/evidence facts\\n\\n**Input:** selected authoritative work/evidence carriers, caller-selected view,\\nor an already-authorized actor/owner record and exact named Writer interface,\\ngrant, target preimage and update conditions. **Output/checks:** source-linked\\nprojections of existing work, progress/support, residuals and next-action\\nscope/support/owner; for an authorized write, the exact applied record and\\nobserved effect/result identity or refusal. Preserve original owner wording\\nseparately from interpretation and method-owned distinctions among verdict,\\nrecommendation, disposition, checkpoint, closure and release. **Limit:** create\\nno rival task ledger, owner decision, role transition or continuation grant;\\nthe tool records a supplied decision, never mechanically adopts a review\\nrecommendation or mutates as an F_P Executive/Reviewer. Owners:\\n[PDEF](fd-source-owner-map.md#pdef) §8;\\n[TICK](fd-source-owner-map.md#tick) §7;\\n[ACT](fd-source-owner-map.md#act) §5;\\n[EVAL](fd-source-owner-map.md#eval) §4;\\n[EXEC](fd-source-owner-map.md#exec) §6 if selected.\\n\\n### REQ-AC-FD-012 — Compute affected refresh and prepare reusable handoff\\n\\n**Input:** old/current source observations, exact dependency/impact declarations,\\ndeclared invalidators, existing results/rulings and caller-selected recovery or\\nreuse contract. **Output/checks:** source/derived differences, affected projection\\nand evidence candidates, missing dependency coverage, method-prescribed\\ninvalidation/applicability check results where decidable, and a reconstructable\\nhandoff of still-applicable support, original records/successors, residuals and\\nunreconciled effects. Reacquire named current inputs for the next dependent\\naction; retain partial writes rather than assuming a reset. **Limit:** do not\\nerase history/frozen studies, rewrite old judgments onto new subjects, infer\\nunaffectedness from absent edges, or require replay/rebuild of valid unchanged\\nsupport merely because a session/role changed. F_P resolves unsupported semantic\\nimpact or preservation premises. Owners: [FOUND](fd-source-owner-map.md#found)\\nChange impact and evidence reuse; [RF](fd-source-owner-map.md#rf) §10;\\n[ACT](fd-source-owner-map.md#act) §5/7;\\n[TICK](fd-source-owner-map.md#tick) §7.\\n\\n### REQ-AC-FD-013 — Retain attempt, usage and uncertainty evidence\\n\\n**Input:** invocation/acquisition/check/refresh/repair/review attempt observations\\nand selected accounting/resource contract. **Output/checks:** bound attempt and\\ncost records with units, measured scope, elapsed versus summed actor intervals,\\navailable usage/cache counters, partial/failed calls, unknown counters and any\\n\",\"coordinates\":{\"lines\":[171,230]},\"encoding\":\"utf8\",\"parent_sha256\":\"e3fcebd7e9fbc60dc36ed4c02ee834a96f14226af134809c938169d4712dfc23\",\"selected_sha256\":\"3085b5ff2e945194f11705c06fc7f1e6386a438aa48dbbc470308b83b80e7c02\",\"size_bytes\":3802,\"source\":{\"engine\":\"workspace-regular-file\",\"object\":null,\"path\":\"specification/requirements/fd-support-tools.md\",\"root\":\"product\",\"selector\":{\"lines\":[171,230]},\"sha256\":\"e3fcebd7e9fbc60dc36ed4c02ee834a96f14226af134809c938169d4712dfc23\"}}},\"schema\":\"a_c.fd-support.response/1\",\"status\":\"ok\"}","structuredContent":{"evidence":{"id":"sha256:338d36f720c67bb5e777a2cf2660f7bd1c4049aeadb69850f5103c37452c3c6c","sha256":"338d36f720c67bb5e777a2cf2660f7bd1c4049aeadb69850f5103c37452c3c6c"},"id":"r-fdt-4","operation":"source.read","operation_outcome":{"cause":"declared output available","core_value":"satisfied","evidence":[],"limits":["output availability only; no semantic acceptance"],"predicate":"B(source.read)[request_sha256=05736dca3665607c67b33a6d0209bfd0fe249f3e22f2623a1e10a8b7b47947d5]: declared output availability","source_parent":{"clause":"results","member":"FOUNDATIONS.md","sha256":"fd2d895f90eb39bda0950c1c7ff02057ef5d8ae73fcbc5b3203f7e99081d6e3f"},"value":"returned"},"refusal":null,"result":{"artifact":null,"value":{"acquisition":{},"content":"### REQ-AC-FD-010 — Execute declared checks and method-owned joins\n\n**Input:** exact subject/observations, selected executable or reproducible\ndecidable predicate/proof contract and its provenance/domain/limits, or a\nselected method-owned conjunction/translation with required coverage and inputs.\n**Output/checks:** reproducible `F_D[v]` judgments for the properties actually\nevaluated, counterexamples/gaps, and joins computed only under the supplied\nqualified operator. Preserve source predicate, original domain outcomes,\nnot-performed assessments, uncovered obligations and incompatibilities as the\nowner contract requires. Retain assertion/observation and execution identities.\n**Limit:** do not invent an algebra or stronger claim, turn a necessary-condition\npass into full satisfaction, execute an unsupported arbitrary calculus operation\nor replace F_P/owner judgment. Owners: [AC](fd-source-owner-map.md#ac) §5;\n[FOUND](fd-source-owner-map.md#found) Results/Conjunction of results/Assertions\nand observation; [EVAL](fd-source-owner-map.md#eval) §1/2;\n[ASSURE](fd-source-owner-map.md#assure) §10.\n\n### REQ-AC-FD-011 — Project and record existing work/evidence facts\n\n**Input:** selected authoritative work/evidence carriers, caller-selected view,\nor an already-authorized actor/owner record and exact named Writer interface,\ngrant, target preimage and update conditions. **Output/checks:** source-linked\nprojections of existing work, progress/support, residuals and next-action\nscope/support/owner; for an authorized write, the exact applied record and\nobserved effect/result identity or refusal. Preserve original owner wording\nseparately from interpretation and method-owned distinctions among verdict,\nrecommendation, disposition, checkpoint, closure and release. **Limit:** create\nno rival task ledger, owner decision, role transition or continuation grant;\nthe tool records a supplied decision, never mechanically adopts a review\nrecommendation or mutates as an F_P Executive/Reviewer. Owners:\n[PDEF](fd-source-owner-map.md#pdef) §8;\n[TICK](fd-source-owner-map.md#tick) §7;\n[ACT](fd-source-owner-map.md#act) §5;\n[EVAL](fd-source-owner-map.md#eval) §4;\n[EXEC](fd-source-owner-map.md#exec) §6 if selected.\n\n### REQ-AC-FD-012 — Compute affected refresh and prepare reusable handoff\n\n**Input:** old/current source observations, exact dependency/impact declarations,\ndeclared invalidators, existing results/rulings and caller-selected recovery or\nreuse contract. **Output/checks:** source/derived differences, affected projection\nand evidence candidates, missing dependency coverage, method-prescribed\ninvalidation/applicability check results where decidable, and a reconstructable\nhandoff of still-applicable support, original records/successors, residuals and\nunreconciled effects. Reacquire named current inputs for the next dependent\naction; retain partial writes rather than assuming a reset. **Limit:** do not\nerase history/frozen studies, rewrite old judgments onto new subjects, infer\nunaffectedness from absent edges, or require replay/rebuild of valid unchanged\nsupport merely because a session/role changed. F_P resolves unsupported semantic\nimpact or preservation premises. Owners: [FOUND](fd-source-owner-map.md#found)\nChange impact and evidence reuse; [RF](fd-source-owner-map.md#rf) §10;\n[ACT](fd-source-owner-map.md#act) §5/7;\n[TICK](fd-source-owner-map.md#tick) §7.\n\n### REQ-AC-FD-013 — Retain attempt, usage and uncertainty evidence\n\n**Input:** invocation/acquisition/check/refresh/repair/review attempt observations\nand selected accounting/resource contract. **Output/checks:** bound attempt and\ncost records with units, measured scope, elapsed versus summed actor intervals,\navailable usage/cache counters, partial/failed calls, unknown counters and any\n","coordinates":{"lines":[171,230]},"encoding":"utf8","parent_sha256":"e3fcebd7e9fbc60dc36ed4c02ee834a96f14226af134809c938169d4712dfc23","selected_sha256":"3085b5ff2e945194f11705c06fc7f1e6386a438aa48dbbc470308b83b80e7c02","size_bytes":3802,"source":{"engine":"workspace-regular-file","object":null,"path":"specification/requirements/fd-support-tools.md","root":"product","selector":{"lines":[171,230]},"sha256":"e3fcebd7e9fbc60dc36ed4c02ee834a96f14226af134809c938169d4712dfc23"}}},"schema":"a_c.fd-support.response/1","status":"ok"}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01GnjDYkfSzXM4LBciZ1YyBd","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgAxoshJtfoThAPAaH9bY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015ooYd2bHTPT5jttxEhScEa","name":"mcp__ac_review__source_read","input":{"schema":"a_c.fd-support.request/1","id":"r-prod-2","operation":"source.read","arguments":{"source":{"engine":"workspace-regular-file","object":null,"path":"specification/PRODUCT.md","root":"product","selector":{"lines":[61,100]},"sha256":"9ebc8342affe8c5e0afb08ebe22f3f98f73f7bdc64db00eee17674c47274bef7"},"encoding":"utf8","max_content_bytes":8192}},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6000,"cache_read_input_tokens":83590,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6000},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b9ee27ae-0996-4105-ba6f-30f3c0f28675","uuid":"6748eedc-c07e-427b-9dbd-f6fedf05ed34","timestamp":"2026-10-19T04:27:13.288Z","request_id":"req_011CgAxosNT3PbdsjEdgwuNc","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_015ooYd2bHTPT5jttxEhScEa":{"schema":"a_c.fd-support.request/1","id":"r-prod-2","operation":"source.read","arguments":{"source":{"engine":"workspace-regular-file","object":null,"path":"specification/PRODUCT.md","root":"product","selector":{"lines":[61,100]},"sha256":"9ebc8342affe8c5e0afb08ebe22f3f98f73f7bdc64db00eee17674c47274bef7"},"encoding":"utf8","max_content_bytes":8192}}},"tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_015ooYd2bHTPT5jttxEhScEa","display_name":"Source Read","server_display_name":"a_c.graphify.fd-support","tool_name":"source.read"}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015ooYd2bHTPT5jttxEhScEa","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"evidence\":{\"id\":\"sha256:9eae63354c5350a8a4d438ecaf96026f199d9f0cc1077261433a9efd0117b564\",\"sha256\":\"9eae63354c5350a8a4d438ecaf96026f199d9f0cc1077261433a9efd0117b564\"},\"id\":\"r-prod-2\",\"operation\":\"source.read\",\"operation_outcome\":{\"cause\":\"declared output available\",\"core_value\":\"satisfied\",\"evidence\":[],\"limits\":[\"output availability only; no semantic acceptance\"],\"predicate\":\"B(source.read)[request_sha256=9b9e438304c70a2b891314105d5f0ba3eacbd8937a28056bd684284f0fd40baa]: declared output availability\",\"source_parent\":{\"clause\":\"results\",\"member\":\"FOUNDATIONS.md\",\"sha256\":\"fd2d895f90eb39bda0950c1c7ff02057ef5d8ae73fcbc5b3203f7e99081d6e3f\"},\"value\":\"returned\"},\"refusal\":null,\"result\":{\"artifact\":null,\"value\":{\"acquisition\":{},\"content\":\"| Assemble/check caller-selected reference-frame context; preflight execution contracts | Render the method-owned activation from supplied selections and exact content; check the declared closure, envelope, bindings and Product-bound admission evidence without inventing authority. |\\n| Dispatch through a selected executor; retain observations and notifications | Supply exact context/settings and the existing grant, and expose acknowledgment, output, observed effects, partial evidence and exceptions to the declared consumer. |\\n| Capture/check closed returns; prepare review comparisons; execute declared checks and joins | Preserve actor outputs and their provenance; inspect exact candidate/source/proof, detect binding errors, and evaluate only supported supplied predicates or method-owned operators. |\\n| Project/record existing work and evidence; prepare affected refresh/handoff; retain usage | Read existing owned carriers and apply already-authorized records through named Writer interfaces; preserve actual support, unresolved impact/effects and measured attempt costs across sessions. |\\n\\nThese are tools available at the points where the selected method and F_P actor\\nneed them, not an a_c stage sequence, task-state store or agent topology.\\nPublic interfaces must support direct Worker and Reviewer source/context/proof\\naccess as well as Executive use. Commands, MCP/protocols, storage, executor,\\nprovider and concrete schemas remain tenant HOW. Existing work/evidence owners\\nremain authoritative; a tool view or recorded recommendation is not a decision.\\n\\nIn the target calculus, `F_D[v]` is deterministic evaluation/proof over declared\\nproperties and returns a judgment. Source acquisition, context rendering,\\nserialization, dispatch and authorized recording are named domain operations\\nwith their own contracts; the `F_D` label does not merge their identities or\\nconfer effects. The deterministic wrapper may invoke an F_P actor, but its\\nsemantic output remains F_P. Qualified deterministic evaluation of an already-\\ndeclared predicate or method-owned conjunction is supported only within its\\nexplicit checked fragment; F_P supplies semantic selection and unresolved\\njudgment. Existing source-to-model F_P authoring remains a separate capability,\\nnot one of these new deterministic evaluations.\\n\\n## Method ownership and basis roles\\n\\nThe [source-owner map](requirements/fd-source-owner-map.md) binds provisional\\nSTDO3.0 derivation reference commit\\n`494451522072ec34381c644f1ccfa2331f2b1e27`, package\\n`specification_methodology/v3/build_tenants/common/`, tree\\n`082df4ea2b7b3658aab528bbfbcfe81234ccc810`, with exact member digests and deciding\\nclauses for each tool requirement. That common candidate is not accepted,\\nreleased or installed. It identifies the contracts from which the requested\\ntoolset is derived; it is not an operative a_c constitution or a published v3\\nrelease identity.\\n\\nThis implementation's builder remains the exact installed STDO v2.5.1-rc.2\\nselected in `stdo_a_c.json`. A consumer workspace's exact selected operative\\nmethod/profile is a separate input, and represented subject versions are another\\nbasis role. A supported binding or explicitly qualified translation must resolve\\nthose inputs; label equality, file presence and co-location do not compose them.\\n\",\"coordinates\":{\"lines\":[61,100]},\"encoding\":\"utf8\",\"parent_sha256\":\"9ebc8342affe8c5e0afb08ebe22f3f98f73f7bdc64db00eee17674c47274bef7\",\"selected_sha256\":\"e769b60fc6caa74a4ce9759d17f78ddb7a9c149fa19a1ef22ce6966a23c4847e\",\"size_bytes\":3300,\"source\":{\"engine\":\"workspace-regular-file\",\"object\":null,\"path\":\"specification/PRODUCT.md\",\"root\":\"product\",\"selector\":{\"lines\":[61,100]},\"sha256\":\"9ebc8342affe8c5e0afb08ebe22f3f98f73f7bdc64db00eee17674c47274bef7\"}}},\"schema\":\"a_c.fd-support.response/1\",\"status\":\"ok\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b9ee27ae-0996-4105-ba6f-30f3c0f28675","uuid":"95e2de87-ccb0-47eb-8d21-be9e9e6d4210","timestamp":"2026-10-19T04:27:13.521Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"evidence\":{\"id\":\"sha256:9eae63354c5350a8a4d438ecaf96026f199d9f0cc1077261433a9efd0117b564\",\"sha256\":\"9eae63354c5350a8a4d438ecaf96026f199d9f0cc1077261433a9efd0117b564\"},\"id\":\"r-prod-2\",\"operation\":\"source.read\",\"operation_outcome\":{\"cause\":\"declared output available\",\"core_value\":\"satisfied\",\"evidence\":[],\"limits\":[\"output availability only; no semantic acceptance\"],\"predicate\":\"B(source.read)[request_sha256=9b9e438304c70a2b891314105d5f0ba3eacbd8937a28056bd684284f0fd40baa]: declared output availability\",\"source_parent\":{\"clause\":\"results\",\"member\":\"FOUNDATIONS.md\",\"sha256\":\"fd2d895f90eb39bda0950c1c7ff02057ef5d8ae73fcbc5b3203f7e99081d6e3f\"},\"value\":\"returned\"},\"refusal\":null,\"result\":{\"artifact\":null,\"value\":{\"acquisition\":{},\"content\":\"| Assemble/check caller-selected reference-frame context; preflight execution contracts | Render the method-owned activation from supplied selections and exact content; check the declared closure, envelope, bindings and Product-bound admission evidence without inventing authority. |\\n| Dispatch through a selected executor; retain observations and notifications | Supply exact context/settings and the existing grant, and expose acknowledgment, output, observed effects, partial evidence and exceptions to the declared consumer. |\\n| Capture/check closed returns; prepare review comparisons; execute declared checks and joins | Preserve actor outputs and their provenance; inspect exact candidate/source/proof, detect binding errors, and evaluate only supported supplied predicates or method-owned operators. |\\n| Project/record existing work and evidence; prepare affected refresh/handoff; retain usage | Read existing owned carriers and apply already-authorized records through named Writer interfaces; preserve actual support, unresolved impact/effects and measured attempt costs across sessions. |\\n\\nThese are tools available at the points where the selected method and F_P actor\\nneed them, not an a_c stage sequence, task-state store or agent topology.\\nPublic interfaces must support direct Worker and Reviewer source/context/proof\\naccess as well as Executive use. Commands, MCP/protocols, storage, executor,\\nprovider and concrete schemas remain tenant HOW. Existing work/evidence owners\\nremain authoritative; a tool view or recorded recommendation is not a decision.\\n\\nIn the target calculus, `F_D[v]` is deterministic evaluation/proof over declared\\nproperties and returns a judgment. Source acquisition, context rendering,\\nserialization, dispatch and authorized recording are named domain operations\\nwith their own contracts; the `F_D` label does not merge their identities or\\nconfer effects. The deterministic wrapper may invoke an F_P actor, but its\\nsemantic output remains F_P. Qualified deterministic evaluation of an already-\\ndeclared predicate or method-owned conjunction is supported only within its\\nexplicit checked fragment; F_P supplies semantic selection and unresolved\\njudgment. Existing source-to-model F_P authoring remains a separate capability,\\nnot one of these new deterministic evaluations.\\n\\n## Method ownership and basis roles\\n\\nThe [source-owner map](requirements/fd-source-owner-map.md) binds provisional\\nSTDO3.0 derivation reference commit\\n`494451522072ec34381c644f1ccfa2331f2b1e27`, package\\n`specification_methodology/v3/build_tenants/common/`, tree\\n`082df4ea2b7b3658aab528bbfbcfe81234ccc810`, with exact member digests and deciding\\nclauses for each tool requirement. That common candidate is not accepted,\\nreleased or installed. It identifies the contracts from which the requested\\ntoolset is derived; it is not an operative a_c constitution or a published v3\\nrelease identity.\\n\\nThis implementation's builder remains the exact installed STDO v2.5.1-rc.2\\nselected in `stdo_a_c.json`. A consumer workspace's exact selected operative\\nmethod/profile is a separate input, and represented subject versions are another\\nbasis role. A supported binding or explicitly qualified translation must resolve\\nthose inputs; label equality, file presence and co-location do not compose them.\\n\",\"coordinates\":{\"lines\":[61,100]},\"encoding\":\"utf8\",\"parent_sha256\":\"9ebc8342affe8c5e0afb08ebe22f3f98f73f7bdc64db00eee17674c47274bef7\",\"selected_sha256\":\"e769b60fc6caa74a4ce9759d17f78ddb7a9c149fa19a1ef22ce6966a23c4847e\",\"size_bytes\":3300,\"source\":{\"engine\":\"workspace-regular-file\",\"object\":null,\"path\":\"specification/PRODUCT.md\",\"root\":\"product\",\"selector\":{\"lines\":[61,100]},\"sha256\":\"9ebc8342affe8c5e0afb08ebe22f3f98f73f7bdc64db00eee17674c47274bef7\"}}},\"schema\":\"a_c.fd-support.response/1\",\"status\":\"ok\"}","structuredContent":{"evidence":{"id":"sha256:9eae63354c5350a8a4d438ecaf96026f199d9f0cc1077261433a9efd0117b564","sha256":"9eae63354c5350a8a4d438ecaf96026f199d9f0