ols, storage, executor,\nprovider and concrete schemas remain tenant HOW. Existing work/evidence owners\nremain authoritative; a tool view or recorded recommendation is not a decision.\n\nIn the target calculus, `F_D[v]` is deterministic evaluation/proof over declared\nproperties and returns a judgment. Source acquisition, context rendering,\nserialization, dispatch and authorized recording are named domain operations\nwith their own contracts; the `F_D` label does not merge their identities or\nconfer effects. The deterministic wrapper may invoke an F_P actor, but its\nsemantic output remains F_P. Qualified deterministic evaluation of an already-\ndeclared predicate or method-owned conjunction is supported only within its\nexplicit checked fragment; F_P supplies semantic selection and unresolved\njudgment. Existing source-to-model F_P authoring remains a separate capability,\nnot one of these new deterministic evaluations.\n\n## Method ownership and basis roles\n\nThe [source-owner map](requirements/fd-source-owner-map.md) binds provisional\nSTDO3.0 derivation reference commit\n`494451522072ec34381c644f1ccfa2331f2b1e27`, package\n`specification_methodology/v3/build_tenants/common/`, tree\n`082df4ea2b7b3658aab528bbfbcfe81234ccc810`, with exact member digests and deciding\nclauses for each tool requirement. That common candidate is not accepted,\nreleased or installed. It identifies the contracts from which the requested\ntoolset is derived; it is not an operative a_c constitution or a published v3\nrelease identity.\n\nThis implementation's builder remains the exact installed STDO v2.5.1-rc.2\nselected in `stdo_a_c.json`. A consumer workspace's exact selected operative\nmethod/profile is a separate input, and represented subject versions are another\nbasis role. A supported binding or explicitly qualified translation must resolve\nthose inputs; label equality, file presence and co-location do not compose them.\n","coordinates":{"lines":[61,100]},"encoding":"utf8","parent_sha256":"9ebc8342affe8c5e0afb08ebe22f3f98f73f7bdc64db00eee17674c47274bef7","selected_sha256":"e769b60fc6caa74a4ce9759d17f78ddb7a9c149fa19a1ef22ce6966a23c4847e","size_bytes":3300,"source":{"engine":"workspace-regular-file","object":null,"path":"specification/PRODUCT.md","root":"product","selector":{"lines":[61,100]},"sha256":"9ebc8342affe8c5e0afb08ebe22f3f98f73f7bdc64db00eee17674c47274bef7"}}},"schema":"a_c.fd-support.response/1","status":"ok"}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_015ooYd2bHTPT5jttxEhScEa","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
